        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203340/extras/1473da75f67bed7136a9e217fae3d37d.avif?t=1774156307\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Stop: House of Horror</strong> is a first-person indie horror experience where a late-night delivery takes a terrifying turn. As you approach a remote mansion, a pair of dogs suddenly begin chasing you—reacting to a dark presence inside the house. With no choice but to run, you rush toward the mansion for safety… only to become trapped within something far more dangerous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🕯️ Explore a Haunted Mansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate dark rooms, silent hallways, and unsettling environments as you uncover the presence that lurks within. Every corner feels alive. Every sound feels close.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💀 A Presence That Hunts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You escaped the dogs, but something else is roaming the mansion. Experience tense chase sequences and supernatural disturbances designed to keep you alert and uneasy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚪 Escape or Be Trapped Forever</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no real means to defend yourself and nowhere left to hide, your only hope is to find a way out before the house closes in around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔦 Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive lighting and sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying chase encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-room, multi-floor haunted mansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused 20–30 minutes horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ongoing Development:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is actively being updated. Upcoming improvements focus on bug fixes, stability, and visual polish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay footage may reflect an earlier development build.</p>",
